<h1 id="project-notes">Project Notes</h1>
<p>A <em>short</em> intro with <strong>bold text</strong>, <code>inline &lt;code&gt;</code> and a <a href="https://example.org/a?b=1&amp;c=2">link</a>. Second line of the same paragraph, with snake_case_name left alone and an escaped *star*.</p>
